WEBVTT

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:57.740
<i>Up above the forest of slumber</i>

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:04.370
<i>Two moons look down from the sky</i>

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:11.880
<i>Where did you come from,</i>
<i>and where are you going?</i>

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:20.260
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.930
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.780
The wicked witch enchanted the axe.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.740
--Why don't you just come 
in without knocking...

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:38.740
--The cursed axe cut off the woodman's
arms and legs one by one.

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:42.240
--...like all the others...?

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:42.240
--The cursed axe cut off the woodman's
arms and legs one by one.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.490
Ow...

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.910
--The tinsmith had pity on the woodman
and made him new arms and legs out of tin.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.920
--Okay, okay, I'm coming.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:52.170
--The tinsmith had pity on the woodman
and made him new arms and legs out of tin.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.590
Um... Happy Halloween?

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.300
I don't want to hear that from a scarecrow.

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:00.300
Huh?

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.140
What? Why? Why am I a scarecrow?!

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.560
I turned into a scarecrow!

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.730
You, too, huh?

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:08.620
Huh?

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.020
Read this!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:13.900
Who are you?

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:16.360
I am traveling incognito,
so I cannot tell you my name.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.340
These medals show that I am of high rank!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.450
"High rank"...?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.170
"I want to see you."

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.260
Nene is calling me...

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.670
Nene?

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.250
Her name is Nene Higashiyama.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:41.810
Nene...

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.510
Nene is in the highest tower in the world.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.950
If she isn't rescued, then we
will remain like this forever.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:50.890
No way!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:51.750
It's true.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.610
What, seriously?

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.730
Seriously? Seriously?!

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.240
She might be a witch.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.450
Aah! A lion!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.740
It's me, Kanzaki. Roar!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:04.910
From that stupid-sounding voice,
you must be Haruto.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.040
Seriously?!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:07.700
She is not a witch. She's Nene.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.200
Let's leave the scarecrow
as the only brainless one.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.370
How rude.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.790
"Brainless"...?

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.960
With this, we have everyone
we need for our journey.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.090
Hurry. We're running out of time.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.500
Before this flower loses all its petals,

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.590
we must get to the
highest tower in the world!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:21.930
Okay!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.550
Wait, where is it?

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:28.600
Do we need special glasses to see the tower?

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.350
No, the door is here.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:34.900
"Door"?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.450
We must hurry.

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:08.010
Hey, Tin Man!

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:08.930
I'm not a tin man!

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.600
Then what should I call you?!

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:11.640
How about "Yoshitsune"?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.730
"Yoshitsune"... That is a good name.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:15.560
Why "Yoshitsune"?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.020
When you think of Nene--

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.270
She was married to Hideyoshi, wasn't she?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:19.730
History's outside my area of expertise.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.940
Hey, come on!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:23.070
"Joy" "Anger" "Grief"
"Pleasure" "Hate"

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.860
Extra! Extra!

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.700
Extra! Extra!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.530
Extra! Extra!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.330
Extra! Extra!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.620
Extra!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.250
"Crown Prince Pol from
the Kingdom of Valanga Studies Abroad"
"I love Japan!" "Things I'm interested in: Rice balls, Mt. Fuji, Anime, Pacific saury"

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.880
"Space of Joy"

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.430
So high!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:48.260
It certainly is the tallest
tower in the world.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.020
Some friends have come to join us
from the other side of the sea!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.560
--Wow, so big!
--Black!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.850
Are they really kids?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.980
--If they're friends, then they must be kids, right?
--Mr. Kuma, they're scary!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.660
Pot, stand next to me.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.950
Will you tell us your names?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.040
Yes, sir.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.000
"Pol"

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.250
I'm--

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.460
Where did you come from?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.580
"Yoshiko"
"Marimo"
"Toshi" "Jun"

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.000
Have you ever seen Nessie?

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.210
"Mikan"
"Hana"
"Satoshi"

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.880
Do you like chocolate?

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.710
"Nene"
"Toshi"

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.300
Are you two friends?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:27.340
"Pot"

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.070
Yeah, we are.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:30.750
He's my best friend, Pot!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.100
Prince Pol...

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:33.810
That's what I thought.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.980
My name is Pol.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.730
I'm Nene.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.100
Nene...

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.520
Extra! Extra!

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.360
Extra! Extra!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.320
Extra! Extra!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.830
We must hurry.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:05.340
Aha! This must be the
"five passions" they have in China.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.920
"Five passions"?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:10.510
Earlier, we were in the "joy" space from
"joy, anger, grief, pleasure, hate."

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.510
If we're going in order, next would be--

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.100
"Anger"?

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.930
Extra! Extra!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.680
Extra! Extra!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.270
Extra! Extra!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.610
"Space of Pleasure"

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.950
What part of this...

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.330
...is "pleasure"?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.600
I-I thought I was going to die...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.390
Pol?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.720
Prince Pol?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.560
--I'll go--
--Pot?

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.810
Pot!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.360
Pot...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.610
"Treatment Room"

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:19.330
Pot...

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.780
It's okay. Pot will be okay.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.460
Po--

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:26.670
Pot!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:32.840
I'm glad...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.640
What should we do with this little one?

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.390
I didn't think about that!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.420
M-My stomach...

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.270
To the infirmary!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.120
This will be your home starting today.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:01.750
I'm glad.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.960
Yay!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.920
Raise your hands!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.040
Yay!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.210
Yay...

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.170
Yay.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.630
Kuro! Where are you, Kuro?

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:22.310
Oh, stop it, Kuro!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:30.690
Kuro...

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.330
A crab!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.040
A crab!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:45.830
A broom!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.840
A broom!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.710
Marimo.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.220
Here!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:55.840
Is the new student, Kuro, here?

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:05.230
Prince Pol!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.900
Are you hurt?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.540
Your leg... Pot?

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.760
It doesn't hurt?

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:17.240
No... As you can see!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.160
Pot!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.130
"Sunny Kingdom"

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.130
Finished!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.340
Yeah, we're done!

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:38.720
Yes.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:41.720
Pol, become a wonderful king, okay?

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.060
I will, I promise.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.520
I'll make my kingdom one as warm as the sun

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.980
where everyone can live happily.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.150
I'll always support you!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:52.650
Thanks.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.150
Please smile. Okay--

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.570
Sunny--!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.290
Nene and I...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.460
Iron bridge... turtle...

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.460
Rubber band...

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.920
Helicopter!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.710
Paper crane!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.930
The sun!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.860
"Space of Grief"

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.240
Kuro!

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:46.040
Kuro!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.410
Kuro, no!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.250
Kuro!

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:48.790
I will--

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.790
I'll go!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.080
Prince Pol!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.920
Wait for me, Kuro!

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.770
Pot! What's wrong, Pot?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:26.990
Kuro!

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:30.230
Kuro...!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.070
Hey.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:52.770
Where are we?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.690
Looks like some sort of control room.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:55.440
Yoshitsune?!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:15.460
This is...

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:18.130
I want to see you...

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:20.960
I want to see you...

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.270
I wanted to see you, too.

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:25.510
It's me! I came to see you!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.850
I want to see you...

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:32.960
Nene!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:34.350
Wai--

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.770
Extra! Extra!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.360
Extra! Extra!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:39.860
Extra!

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.190
"Great Famine"
"70,000 Die from Starvation"

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.190
"70,000 Die from Starvation"

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.070
What does it mean to die from starvation?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:46.500
It is when someone dies because
they do not have enough food to eat.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:51.200
If they don't have food,
then they should just eat cake!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.430
Is it okay for us to be 
in a place like this?!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.480
Huh?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.150
Damn it!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.560
What should we do?!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.630
I feel...

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.760
"Anger"

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.250
...sad.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.260
Lily?

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.340
"Anger"

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.720
That's not the moon.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.470
"Anger" "Anger" "Anger"

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.730
I want to see you...

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.480
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.650
Anger energy... full!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.230
Huh?

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.580
Extra! Extra!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.710
Extra! Extra... Extra...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.420
See you later!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.220
You reap what you sow.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:30.760
What?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.860
Karma?

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.900
I want to see you...

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:42.860
Nene...

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.780
I came to see you!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.240
I want to see you...

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.240
I wanted to see you, too!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.750
Mr. Kuma was kind, wasn't he?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.250
Don't you want to study
with everyone again?

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.210
I want to see you...

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.590
Wasn't Kuro cute?

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.180
I want to see you...

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.300
Kuro died...

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:19.860
I was really sad, but I
worked hard and became king!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.480
Because of my promise to you

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.690
that I would make my kingdom
as warm as the sun!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.130
I want to see you...

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.900
But you're not here anymore...

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.010
You killed him...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.470
You killed him...

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.550
You killed him!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.060
Nene...?

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.560
"Hate"

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.060
Joy, anger, grief, pleasure, hate.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:06.730
With this, we've got all five emotions.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.480
I loved him!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.860
I loved him, too!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.740
He was a dear friend!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.280
But you killed him!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.990
It couldn't be helped!

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:20.290
If I hadn't killed Pot, then I wouldn't
have been able to become king!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.370
That's why you killed him!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.420
The tower is...?!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.880
Nene!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.220
Suspension bridge.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.520
Rice paddy.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.980
River. See?

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:50.650
That is the kingdom you wanted
so badly you killed your friend for it...

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.780
Your kingdom, which will soon
disappear from this world.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.870
What about my kingdom?

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.910
Do you remember?

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.120
What Pot, you, and I used
to play all the time...

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:05.460
You've forgotten?

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.140
I didn't forget. Let's see...

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.420
Cat's... cradle...?

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.260
Suspension bridge.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.430
Nene, wait!

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.350
Suspension bridge...?

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.200
Nene!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.200
Frog!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.330
Turtle!

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:51.170
Did you forget?

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.590
Your toy--

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.510
It'll be terrible if you push the button.

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.130
Boom!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:59.090
That's a joke, right?

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.390
So pretty...

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.600
It's the end, so let's burn it
into our memories.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:09.190
Oh, but you'll just forget
everything anyway...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.610
That's not--

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.530
Nene, what should I do?

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.440
Tell me!

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.320
I'll do anything!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.620
Did you forget?

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.830
That's... a dog?

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.330
You really did forget everything.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:30.830
An ogre?

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:36.090
I can't remember...

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:38.340
You don't remember killing Pot, either?

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.250
Did you forget?

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:10.120
Pot... was killed by me...

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.130
I will never forget that!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.130
There's no way I could forget!

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:43.950
A misfire?

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.460
This is the end, I think?

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.400
Nene?

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.470
Nene!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.180
Nene! Nene?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.360
"Treason"
"Pot"

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.730
Pot...

00:20:55.850 --> 00:21:01.070
<i>And then there were none</i>

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:06.740
<i>And then there were none</i>

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.910
"And Now There Are None..."

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:11.870
<i>The memory in my mind is real,</i>
<i>we formed our vow with bonds like steel</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:17.130
<i>Laughing together was warm,</i>
<i>the future was full of hope, not harm</i>

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:22.300
<i>Didn’t we have the same dream,</i>
<i>back in our secret place?</i>

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:27.640
<i>Yet you’re tearing it apart--</i>
